### Get the next race 
GET http://localhost:3001/api/races/next

### Get specific driverstandings per year
GET http://localhost:3001/api/driverstandings?year=2025

### test drivers standings 
Get http://localhost:3001/api/currentStandingsTest

### See what result for last race in a season per year returns
Get http://localhost:3001/api/driverStandings?year=2024

### Constructor standings
Get http://localhost:3001/api/constructorStandings?year=2024


//################### CORE ################################//

### driver
GET http://localhost:3001/api/driver?name=localhost:3001/api/driver?name=Lewis_Hamilton

### driver all
GET http://localhost:3001/api/driver


### constructor
GET http://localhost:3001/api/constructor?id=1

### constructor all
GET http://localhost:3001/api/constructor


### circuit
GET http://localhost:3001/api/circuit?id=1

### circuit all
GET http://localhost:3001/api/circuit

### race
GET http://localhost:3001/api/race?year=1999&name=australia

### race all
GET http://localhost:3001/api/race?year=2001

### all race with name
GET http://localhost:3001/api/race?name=australia

